join green_interviewer center

green_interviewer: Terakhir - Visi anda untuk sustainable future?

[signal arg="timer_start"]

- Renewable energy, circular economy, dan green technology
	set {interview_score} += 20
	set {interview_health} += 20
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	green_interviewer: Outstanding vision! You understand the complete picture.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- Dunia yang lebih hijau dan bersih
	set {interview_score} += 12
	set {interview_health} += 12
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	green_interviewer: Beautiful vision! Though we need more specific strategies.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- Semoga aja ada solusinya nanti
	set {interview_score} -= 5
	set {interview_health} -= 5
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	green_interviewer: Passive hope won't save our planet. We need active commitment.
	[signal arg="wrong_choice"]

- Dunia akan baik-baik saja tanpa usaha
	set {interview_score} -= 15
	set {interview_health} -= 15
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	green_interviewer: That ignorance is exactly what's killing our environment.
	[signal arg="wrong_choice"]

[wait time="1.0"]
[signal arg="update_ui"]

# Final interview conclusion
[wait time="1.0"]

green_interviewer: Environmental assessment complete.

if {interview_score} >= 35:
	green_interviewer: Incredible environmental awareness! You're our green champion. Welcome to GreenCorp!
elif {interview_score} >= 20:
	green_interviewer: Solid environmental mindset. We'll discuss next steps.
elif {interview_score} >= 10:
	green_interviewer: Some awareness, but need deeper environmental commitment.
else:
	green_interviewer: Sorry, environmental values tidak align dengan misi kami.

set {day4_completed} = true
set {day4_score} = {interview_score}

leave green_interviewer
